@startuml 005-component
title 005 組件圖：搶答與判定

skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang TC"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 50

actor "學生（各組，每組可多個分頁）" as Student
actor "老師" as Teacher

package "前端（瀏覽器）" {
  package "001 的頁面（最終版，不修改，只依介面呈現）" #EEEEEE {
    component "StudentPlayPage\n(S-Answer / S-Submitted)" as PPlay
    component "ConsolePage\n(T-Live)" as PConsole
  }
  component "SubmissionService" <<interface>> as ISub
  component "createServiceRegistry()\n組合根：只改 submission 的綁定" as Registry
  component "ServerSubmissionService\n（005 新增）" as SSub
  component "RealtimeClient\n（004 提供，每分頁一條連線）" as SockClient #EEEEEE
  component "ApiClient\n（002 提供，帶 Bearer）" as TeacherHttp #EEEEEE
}

package "伺服器（Fastify + Socket.IO，唯一權威來源）" {
  package "005 搶答與判定" {
    component "SubmissionGateway\nSocket.IO：submission:submit、submission:own" as Gateway
    component "SubmissionRoutes\nHTTP：列出送出、判定" as Routes
    component "SubmissionEngine\n驗證、順位、判定、自動結束" as Engine
    component "SubmissionStore\n每題送出、判定、成功組別" as Store
    component "SubmissionVisibility\n依角色產生送出資料" as Visibility
    component "SubmissionNotifier\n推送老師列表；通知該組組員送出、判定" as Notifier
  }
  package "002 老師登入" #EEEEEE {
    component "buildApp\n(app.register)" as BuildApp
    component "app.requireTeacher\npreHandler" as ReqTeacher
    component "app.io\nTEACHER_ROOM" as SockAuth
    component "pino logger" as Logger
  }
  package "004 活動與階段" #EEEEEE {
    component "CommandQueue\n開放、結束、送出、判定\n共用同一個順序" as Queue
    component "SequenceClock\nstamp()" as Clock
    component "ActivityStore\n階段、目前題號、題目、openedAt" as ActStore
    component "GroupMembership\ngroupOf(socket)" as Membership
    component "ActivityManager\nendQuestion(n)、snapshot(TEACHER)" as EndQ
  }
  package "006 結果與寫回" #EEEEEE {
    component "ResultService（伺服器）" as Res006
  }
}

Student --> PPlay : 填寫、整組送出
Teacher --> PConsole : 接受／不接受

PPlay ..> ISub : submitAnswer / getGroupSubmission /\nonGroupSubmitted / onJudgement
PConsole ..> ISub : listSubmissions / onSubmissionsChange / judge
Registry --> ISub
SSub -up-|> ISub
Registry --> SSub
SSub --> SockClient : emitWithAck(submission:submit、submission:own)\n監聽 submissions:changed、submission:groupSubmitted、\nsubmission:judged；onConnect 時補取
SSub --> TeacherHttp : GET 送出列表\nPOST 判定（回傳 JudgeOutcome）

SockClient <--> Gateway : WebSocket（app.io）
TeacherHttp --> Routes : HTTP REST

BuildApp --> Routes : app.register
Gateway ..> Membership : 依連線判斷組別（原則 VI）
Gateway --> Queue : run(submit)
Routes ..> ReqTeacher : 只有老師（REQ-SUB-17）
Routes --> Queue : run(judge)
Routes --> Store : 列出送出（唯讀）
Queue --> Engine : 一筆處理完才處理下一筆
Engine ..> ActStore : 讀取階段、題目、openedAt；\nsubscribe：結束時把待判定改為未判定
Engine --> Clock : 接受時間
Engine --> Store : 寫入送出、判定
Engine ..> EndQ : 接受後自動結束本題（同一個 run 內）；\nJudgeOutcome.activity
Engine ..> Notifier : 處理完後才通知（不在臨界區）
Engine ..> Logger : 記錄順位與判定
Notifier --> Visibility
Visibility --> Store
Notifier ..> SockAuth : 列表只送 io.to(TEACHER_ROOM)
Notifier ..> Membership : 組員送出、判定只送 groupOf = 該組的連線
Res006 ..> Store : 每題送出與成功組別

note right of Queue
  時序正確（REQ-SUB-07、NFR-01）：
  004 的開放、結束題目與 005 的送出、判定
  在同一條佇列（004 REQ-ACT-17），
  臨界區只做「驗證 → 取順位 → 寫入」，
  中間沒有 await、沒有網路傳送。
end note

note bottom of Visibility
  R9：學生只收到本組的送出，
  rank 一律為 0（REQ-SUB-16；
  001 改成可選後改為不放）
end note
@enduml
